1. DEFINITIONS
"Toolkit" means the Microvania Toolkit and everything distributed with it,
including source code, scripts, editor and Tiled extensions, templates,
configuration files, tools and documentation.
"Game" means a game or other interactive application made with the Toolkit.
"Commercial Use" means any use for which you or anyone else receives money
or other compensation, directly or indirectly. It includes:
  (a) selling a Game, or charging for access, downloads, subscriptions,
      downloadable content or in-game items;
  (b) showing advertising in a Game, or receiving sponsorship for it;
  (c) receiving donations, tips, pay-what-you-want payments, crowdfunding
      or patronage connected to a Game;
  (d) using the Toolkit for a client or employer, or inside a business;
  (e) offering the Toolkit or a Game as part of a paid product, service,
      course or bundle.
"Personal Use" means any use that is not Commercial Use.
"Demonstration Assets" means all art, music and sound included with the
Toolkit or its sample worlds, unless a notice for a specific file says
otherwise.

